<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins generally steady; butts steady to $1.00 lower; skinned hams steady; seedless bellies steady to 2.00 higher; lean trimmings generally steady to weak.</p>
<p>Trading slow to moderate, with light to moderate demand and mostly moderate offerings.</p>
